* 1 Nov 26 dm  S.99 (look only): names its focus boxes (ctx<TK.C.FOCI>), so $tk_frame marks the one with the focus [*] and the other [-], as the IDE does.
* 1 Nov 26 dm  S.97 stage 2: the AI line ($tk_aipage), as tool.voc has it: F6 or AI > Ask the AI, in both panes; filter, refresh and the output pane of the runs are offered to
